-- Phase 3 of the NPC / bestiary work, second book: every species Palladium
-- Fantasy Dragons and Gods stats - its fourteen dragons, the elementals, the Alien
-- Intelligence and its Essence Fragment, the four Spirits of Light, and the
-- minion species inside the god chapters (Ramen, Phoenixi, Tautons, Crocodillians,
-- the Pandemonium Greater Demon, Mormo Ravens) - rows for creatures (migration
-- 074) and their attacks in stat_attacks (owner_kind 'creature').
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration.
--
-- NOT HERE: the gods, demon lords and named dragons (notable_npcs, #1166); the
-- hatchling rules, which say which dragons players may take but stat no species
-- of their own; and the minions the book only names or defers to another book
-- (Demon Locusts, the Worms of Taut, Guardian Spiders).
--
-- A PALLADIUM FANTASY BOOK: an S.D.C. world, so a row's pools are its hit points,
-- S.D.C. and A.R., and the book's Rifts Earth M.D.C. conversion is in pools_note -
-- the reverse of Conversion Book One. A dragon row is the ADULT; the hatchling and
-- ancient figures are in pools_note.
--
-- EXTRACTED by seven book-extract-workers, every number read off a 200 dpi render
-- rather than the OCR cache, which carries the digit cipher. Three of them stopped
-- at their slice's last page with a block unfinished (Great Horned Dragon, Serpent
-- of the Wind, Major Water Elemental); a seventh read those three whole.
-- RECONCILED by book-reconcile against the renders, row by row; its corrections
-- are applied. Every row passes creatureFormulaGaps, the grammar the endpoint
-- rolls with. description and natural_abilities are short paraphrases - no
-- sentence is the book's.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/add-creatures-dragons-and-gods.sql
--
-- BY CATEGORY:
--   dragon (14): Basilisk Dragon, Chiang-Ku Dragon, Cockatrice Dragon, Fire Dragon,
--     Hydra Dragon, Ice Dragon, Kukulcan Feathered Serpent, Lo-Dox Dragon, Night
--     Stalker Dragon, Thunder Lizard Dragon, Ultucan Dragon, Wooly Dragon, Great
--     Horned Dragon, Serpent of the Wind
--   elemental (12): Minor Earth Elemental, Earth-Tree or Plant Elemental, Minor
--     Earth-Lava Elemental, Mud Mound, Major Earth Elemental, Minor Air Elemental,
--     Major Air Elemental, Minor Fire Elemental, Major Fire Elemental, Minor Water
--     Elemental, Minor Ice Elemental, Major Water Elemental
--   alien (2): Alien Intelligences, Essence Fragment
--   angel (4): Cheruu, Seraph, Ariel, Tharsis
--   humanoid (3): Ramen, Phoenixi, Tautons
--   animal (2): Crocodillians, Mormo Ravens
--   demon (1): Pandemonium, Greater Demon

  'basilisk-dragon', 'Basilisk Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, typically anarchist or evil', '{"IQ":"1D6+12","MA":"1D6+6","ME":"2D6+12","PS":"2D6+22","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"1D6+20","PB":"2D6+1","Spd":"4D6+6"}', '3D4x100+40+PE', '4D6x10+40', NULL, '1D6x100+PE', NULL, 'Cannot fly. Hatchling: HP 4D6x10, SDC 2D4x10+2D6/level, PPE 1D6x10+PE, AR 8, HF 11; attributes reroll (IQ 3D6, MA 2D6, ME 4D6, PS 4D6, PP 3D6, PE 4D6, PB 1D6+1, Spd 3D6); hatchling abilities/attacks/damage/skills at half adult level, PPE 2D4x10+40 during hatchling years. Rifts conversion: M.D.C. adult 1D6x100+70, hatchling 4D6x10+40; all other stats fundamentally the same.', 10, 15, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":2,"roll":2}', '+6 save vs horror factor, +4 on all other saves (adult); hatchling +3 HF save, +1 on all others. Supernatural P.S. Called shot to an eye is -6 to strike unless restrained/helpless.; attacks per melee: Five physical, or two physical and three by petrification, or two by magic (adult); three physical, or two physical and one by petrification, or two by magic (hatchling)', 'Basic math 98%; magically understands/speaks all languages 98%; literate Dragonese/Elven 98% plus one other language +20%. Other: demon and monster lore +15%, magic lore +10%, track humanoids +10%, wilderness survival +20%, land navigation +20%, prowl, swim, climb, plus 8 picks from Communication/Espionage/Rogue/Scholar-Technical/W.P. Avg adult level 1D4+6.', 'Nightvision 200ft, sees invisible, tracks by smell, fast bio-regeneration, prehensile tail, magically knows all languages; petrifies victims with its gaze (save vs magic 13), reversible unless slain; a mirror reflects the gaze back onto it.', 'Adults (and NPC hatchlings over 100 yrs) roll: 01-40 none (but +1D4+2 skills), 41-60 1D6+1 level Wizard (2D6 spells/level 1-4), 61-70 1D6 level Warlock, 71-80 1D6 level Diabolist, 81-90 1D6 level Summoner, 91-00 1D6 level Priest. Hatchlings know only magic lore.', NULL, '8 ft (2.4m) long head to rump; whip-like tail an additional 8-10 ft (2.4-3m)', '800 lbs (360 kg)', '600 plus 2D6x10 years; matures at about 200 years; oldest recorded lived to 2000', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found anywhere but prefers lands north of the Yin-Sloth Jungles and Land of the South Winds; most common in the Western Empire, Old Kingdom, Lopan, and lower Eastern Territory', 'Demons and supernatural beings; occasionally members of the monster races', 'Humanoids in general; particularly humans and Elves', 'Player characters (hatchlings) may select a magic O.C.C.', 'Small wingless dragon, cunning and greedy, secretly manipulates rulers and covets wealth; petrifies foes with its gaze but lacks the size or shapeshifting of true dragons.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.21-22');
  'chiang-ku-dragon', 'Chiang-Ku Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, typically good or selfish', '{"IQ":"3D6+12","MA":"3D6+12","ME":"3D6+12","PS":"3D6+12","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"2D6+10","PB":"2D6+10","Spd":"3D6+12"}', '3D4x100+1000', '4D6x100', NULL, '2D4x100+200+PE', '3D4x10+ME', 'HP figure (3D4x100+1000) is the natural serpent form; in human form do not add the 1000 (HP 3D4x100 only). Hatchling: HP 1D4x100 human form plus 100 in serpent form, SDC 2D6x10+3D6/level, PPE 2D4x10+20, AR 11, HF 9; attributes IQ/ME/MA/PS 3D6+4, PP/PE/PB 2D6+3, Spd 3D6+4. Rifts conversion: M.D.C. adult 4D4x100 in human form, always plus 1000 in serpent form; hatchling 1D4x100 human form plus 100 serpent form.', 14, 13, '{"initiative":1,"strike":1,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":2,"roll":2}', '+1 save vs psionics, +3 save vs illusionary magic, +2 save vs all other magic, +4 save vs horror factor (adult); hatchling +1 save vs illusionary magic, +1 vs other magic, +2 vs horror factor.; attacks per melee: Equal to basic hand to hand combat, varies with level of experience; magic tattoos add one attack per melee (adult)', 'Basic/advanced math 96%; all domestic skills 80%; magically understands/speaks all languages 98%; literate Dragonese/Elven 98% plus 3 other languages +30%. Other: art +10%, writing +10%, disguise +5%, holistic medicine +10%, climbing +10%, faerie lore +15%, demon and monster lore +5%, land navigation, wilderness survival, streetwise, plus 3 picks each from Communications/Science/Scholar-Technical and 3 ancient plus 3 modern W.P. Avg adult level 1D4+7.', 'Immune to poison/toxin/drug/gas, nightvision, sees invisible, resists fire/cold, dimensional teleport 90%, bio-regenerates; the supreme dragon shapeshifter, becoming any animal, a human, or mist indefinitely, even unconscious; keeps secret tattoo magic it almost never uses.', 'Born with full understanding of magic; secret tattoo magic (Elixir of Power and Deceit) essentially never used on the Palladium World. Typical study: 50% Wizardry, 20% Diabolism, 20% Summoning, 5% other/nonmagical. Wizards 8th+ level know all spells lvl 1-9 plus 2D4 higher; 15th+ level know all lvl 1-15 plus many Spells of Legend.', 'Major psionic; selects 7 psi-powers total from one category (sensitive, healing or physical); super psionics unavailable; plus 2 more powers at levels 3, 6, 9 and 12. I.S.P. 3D4x10+ME attribute number.', '12-20 ft (3.6-6.1m) long incl. tail (about one quarter of length); about 4 ft (1.2m) at shoulder; human form 5-6 ft (1.5-1.8m); hatchlings about 10% smaller', '200 lbs (90kg) in human form, 1000 lbs (450kg) in serpent form; hatchlings about 20% lighter', '6000 years; some said to reach 10,000', 'Can be found anywhere', 'Kukulcans and other good-aligned dragons; humans and most Champions of Light; said to associate with the Gods of Light', 'None per se; Champions of Light regard it as a foe of darkness; demons, Deevils and gods of darkness torment and hunt them', NULL, 'Rare, wise Chinese-style dragon and dimensional traveler; a benevolent shapeshifter who secretly guides and protects mortals, especially humans, while mastering magic.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.22-23');
  'cockatrice-dragon', 'Cockatrice Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Typically diabolic evil; less than 10% a different alignment', '{"IQ":"1D6+2","MA":"1D6","ME":"2D6+10","PS":"2D6+22","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"1D6+10","PB":"2D6","Spd":"5D6"}', '5D6x10+60+PE', '4D4x10', NULL, '5D6x10+PE', NULL, 'Adult Spd also 2D6x10+10 flying (running 5D6 is the main figure). Hatchling: HP 2D6x10+20, SDC 2D4x10+10+2D6/level, PPE 2D6x10, AR 10, HF 10; attributes IQ 1D6+1, MA 1D4, ME 2D6+5, PS 2D6+11, PP 2D6+5, PE 1D6+5, PB 2D6, Spd 2D6 running/1D6x10+10 flying. Reaches maturity about 200 years old. Rifts conversion: M.D.C. adult 4D6x10+60, hatchling 2D4x10+30; a mega-damage creature on Rifts Earth, impervious to normal weapons.', 12, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":2,"roll":2}', '+6 save vs horror factor, +3 on all other saves (adult). Supernatural P.S.; attacks per melee: Five physical, or two physical and three by breath attack (adult); three physical, or two physical and one by breath attack (hatchling)', 'Basic math 60%; speaks a guttural Gobblely and Dragonese/Elven at 90%. Other: demon and monster lore +10%, track animals +10%, track humanoids +20%, wilderness survival +20%, land navigation +20%, interrogation +10%, plus 4 picks from Rogue/Wilderness and one W.P. (typically knife). Avg adult level 1D4+2.', 'Nightvision, sees invisible, hawk-like sight/hearing, tracks by sight, swims, climbs, prowls, bio-regenerates, short dimensional teleport, ley line phasing; prehensile taloned feet use tools/weapons; withers plants by touch or wish; breathes a toxic stench cone.', NULL, NULL, '12-16 ft (3.6-5m) long, head to tail', '800 lbs (360 kg)', '600+ years; matures at about 200 years', 'Found almost anywhere, most common in monster-race wilderness (Old Kingdom, Yin-Sloth Jungles, Eastern Territory, Great Northern Wilderness); legend places flocks in the Land of the Damned', 'Basilisks; evil dragons; evil sorcerers; black priests; witches; other evil supernatural beings', 'Faerie Folk; humans and small humanoids; all lesser creatures are potential victims', 'Player characters (hatchlings) can learn two additional languages at +10%.', 'Bird-headed serpentine predator that hunts faerie folk and small humanoids for pleasure; low intelligence, no magic, and paralyzed by a real roosters crow.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.24-25');
  'fire-dragon', 'Fire Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, tend toward selfish', '{"IQ":"2D6+12","MA":"2D6+12","ME":"2D6+12","PS":"2D6+26","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"3D6+12","PB":"4D6+6","Spd":"2D6x10"}', '1D4x1000+PE', '5D6x100', NULL, '2D4x100+PE', '2D6x10+20', 'Adult Spd also 2D6x10+80 flying (running 2D6x10 is the main figure). Hatchling: HP 1D4x100, SDC 5D6x10+3D6/level, PPE 2D4x10+10/level, AR 10, HF 12; attributes IQ 4D6, MA 4D6, ME 3D6, PS 5D6, PP 3D6+3, PE 3D6+6, PB 5D6, Spd 5D6. Rifts conversion: M.D.C. adult 1D6x1000, hatchling 1D4x100; fire breath becomes 6D6 M.D.; bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C. every five minutes; impervious even to mega-damage heat/fire.', 14, 16, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":3,"roll":3}', '+7 save vs horror factor, +3 on all other saves (adult); hatchling +3 HF save, +1 on all others. Supernatural P.S.; attacks per melee: Eight physical, or four fire breath and four physical, or two by magic (adult); four physical, or two physical and two by fire breath, or two by magic (hatchling)', 'Basic/advanced math 98%; literate Dragonese/Elven plus 4 other languages 98%, plus speaks 6 additional languages 98%. Other: demon and monster lore +20%, faerie lore +15%, gemology +20%, streetwise +12%, plus 14 picks from Communications/Espionage/Military/Physical(non-combat)/Rogue/Science/Scholar-Technical/W.P. Avg adult level 2D4+5.', 'Nightvision, excellent color vision, sees and turns invisible at will, bio-regenerates, immune to fire (even mega-damage fire/plasma), at-will metamorphosis, high self- and dimensional-teleport chance, and all magic/knowledge common to true dragons.', 'Adults (and NPC hatchlings over 100 yrs) 8th+ level know all spells lvl 1-6 plus animate and control dead, turn dead, exorcism, resurrection, remove curse, and 3D4 more from lvl 7-15; 14th+ level know all lvl 1-10 plus 3D4 higher; 20th+ level know all lvl 1-13 plus 1D4+4 higher. 1-45% chance of a second discipline (Summoner/Diabolist/Master of Wizardry/Warlock/Necromancer or priest/other).', 'Adult I.S.P. 2D6x10+20; has all sensitive and physical psi-powers. Hatchling: minor psionic, selects 6 powers from sensitive/physical, plus 2 more at 5th and 10th level; I.S.P. 1D6x10+ME.', '20-30 ft tall (6-9m); up to 65 ft (20m) long; wingspan 100 ft (30.5m)', '25 tons', '6000 years; some known to reach 9000', 'Found anywhere, prefers warm climates; rarely encountered in the Great Northern Wilderness, Land of the Damned, Phi, Lopan, or northern Eastern Territory', 'Fellow dragons other than Fire Dragons; giant races, especially Ogres and Trolls', 'None per se', NULL, 'Massive winged reptilian dragon covered in red scales; a prolific spellcaster fond of human technology and jewelry, though it does not value them as true treasure.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.25-27');
  'hydra-dragon', 'Hydra Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Any, but typically anarchist, miscreant, or diabolic; good Hydras less than 1%', '{"IQ":"1D6+3","MA":"1D6+6","ME":"2D6+10","PS":"2D6+36","PP":"2D6+14","PE":"2D6+14","PB":"3D6+10","Spd":"3D4x10"}', '1D4x1000+2000+PE', '5D6x100', NULL, '1D6x100+200', '100', 'Cannot fly (runs 3D4x10). Hatchling: IQ 1D6+2, MA 1D6+2, ME 2D6+2, PS 2D6+24, PP 2D6+7, PE 2D6+7, PB 4D6, Spd 2D4x10 running; AR 12; HP 3D4x100; SDC 1D6x100+4D6/lvl; PPE 2D4x10+2D6/lvl (a separate hatchling-years note in the book instead gives 2D6x10+10); HF 13; ISP 40, head seven only. Hatchling abilities, attacks, damage and skills are at half adult level; cannot metamorphose or fly. Rifts conversion: MDC adult 1D6x1000+2000, hatchling 2D6x100+100; physical and breath attacks become mega-damage; other stats unchanged.', 14, 17, '{"attacks":16,"initiative":7,"strike":4,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":4,"roll":2}', '+9 save vs horror factor, +2 all other saves (adult); hatchling +6 HF, +1 other saves. Cannot be surprised from behind or above; heads watch all directions.', 'Basic math 50%; guttural Gobblely and Dragonese/Elven 90%; Faerie lore 50%; track animals 70%, track humanoids 60%, track by smell 60%; wilderness survival 90%; land navigation 70%; swim 90%; climb 70%/60%; 5 elective skills from Domestic/Espionage (no locks, pockets, disguise or forgery)/Wilderness, no bonuses. Avg adult level 1D6+2 (old/ancient 1D6+8). Hatchlings: same skills minus electives, at -10%.', 'Nightvision 600ft, infrared/ultraviolet sight split between two heads, invisibility at will, scent tracking, prehensile tail, fire/cold resistance, fast regeneration, weak self and dimensional teleport; each head acts independently and the beast cannot be flanked; two heads cause paralysis or sleep rather than damage.; Head Three breathes paralysing poisonous vapors; Head Six breathes a cloud of slumber (sleep)', 'Sense magic, sense evil, repel animals, animate & control dead, turn dead; known to adult and hatchling alike.', 'ISP 100 total; only head seven has any power (bio-manipulation); hatchling limited to head seven, 40 ISP.', '25 ft tall, 50-60 ft long', '5D6 tons', '3000+ years, some to 6000', 'Anywhere, usually away from population centers', 'None per se; comfortable with evil Faerie Folk', 'None per se; effectively everybody', NULL, 'A savage seven-headed dragon of low intelligence but immense strength, each head firing its own special breath weapon; regrows severed heads and limbs.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.30-33');
  'ice-dragon', 'Ice Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any', '{"IQ":"3D6+8","MA":"2D6+12","ME":"2D6+12","PS":"2D6+26","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"3D6+12","PB":"4D6+6","Spd":"2D4x10"}', '1D4x1000+PE', '4D6x100', NULL, '2D4x100', '2D6x10+30', 'Flies at 3D6x10+60. Hatchling: IQ 3D6+3, MA 2D6+6, ME 2D6+8, PS 2D6+18, PP 2D6+8, PE 3D6+6, PB 4D6, Spd 6D6 running or 2D6x10 flying; AR 10; HP 1D4x100; SDC 4D6x10+3D6/lvl; PPE 2D4x10+10/lvl; HF 10; ISP 1D6x10+ME. Rifts conversion: MDC adult 1D6x1000+100, hatchling 1D4x100; impervious (no damage) to fire and cold; ice breath 5D6 MD; other stats unchanged.', 14, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":4,"roll":4}', '+6 save vs horror factor, +4 other saves (adult); hatchling +4 HF, +2 other saves.', 'Basic/advanced math 98%; literate Dragonese/Elven 98% plus 3 languages of choice; speaks 5 more at 98%; demon and monster lore +20%, faerie lore 10%, gemology +25%, sculpting/whittling (ice) +15%; 12 selections from listed categories, skill level tied to magic level, IQ bonus included. Avg adult level 1D6+6.', 'Nightvision, excellent color vision, sees the invisible, turns invisible at will, fast M.D. regeneration, immune (not just resistant) to fire and cold, metamorphosis at will, weak self/dimensional teleport, breathes a freezing blast, and has poisonous anti-freeze blood.', 'Adult 8th+ level knows all spells 1-5 plus 3D4+3 choice from 6-10; 14th+ adds all 1-8 plus 3D4+1 higher; 20th+ all 1-12 plus 1D4+4 higher; 01-30% chance of a second discipline (table given).', 'Adult has all sensitive and physical psi-powers; hatchling is minor psionic, selects 6 powers.', '20-30 ft tall, up to 65 ft long', '22 tons', '6000 years, some to 9000', 'Cold climates: tundra, mountains, glaciers; Old Kingdom, Phi, Lopan, Eastern Territory, Bizantium, Great Northern Wilderness; 200+ in Land of the Damned', 'Algor and other giants; Wolfen, who once worshipped them', 'None per se', NULL, 'A blue-hued, ice-breathing dragon allied with Wolfen clans as advisors, notably laid-back and arrogant despite great magic and psychic power.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.33-34');
  'kukulcan-feathered-serpent', 'Kukulcan Feathered Serpent', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, but vast majority scrupulous or other good', '{"IQ":"2D6+16","MA":"2D6+18","ME":"2D6+18","PS":"2D6+12","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"2D6+10","PB":"4D6+8","Spd":"4D6"}', '5D6x100+PE', '2D6x100', NULL, '1D6x100+200+PE', '2D4x10+60+ME', 'Flies at 2D4x10+60. Hatchling: IQ 4D6, MA 4D6, ME 4D6, PS 2D6+8, PP 2D6+6, PE 2D6+6, PB 4D6, Spd 4D6 running or 2D4x10 flying; AR 9; HP 6D6x10; SDC 4D6x10+2D6/lvl; PPE 3D4x10+15/lvl; HF/Awe 10; ISP 2D4x10+ME. Rifts conversion: MDC adult 1D6x1000, hatchling 1D4x100; breath does 6D6 SDC to mortals or 1D6 MD to creatures of magic; other stats basically unchanged.', 12, 13, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":4,"pull":4,"roll":4}', '+5 save vs horror factor, +4 other saves (adult); hatchling +3 HF, +2 other saves. Horror Factor is printed as Horror Factor/Awe.', 'Basic/advanced math 98%; literate Dragonese/Elven plus 4 languages of choice 98%; speaks 6 more at 98%; demon and monster lore +30%, faerie lore +20%, gemology +15%, locate secret doors +15%, streetwise +12%; 3 selections from EACH of Communications/Espionage/Medical/Military/Science/Scholar-Technical/Wilderness/Weapon Prof, +10% bonus. Avg adult level 1D6+6.', 'Nightvision, hawk-like color vision, sees the invisible, turns invisible at will, fast regeneration, fire/cold resistance, metamorphosis at will, self and dimensional teleport, breathes a poisonous vapor cloud.', 'Adult intuitively knows all air elemental magic levels 1-6; 01-60% chance of an additional discipline (table given).', 'Adult master psionic: all sensitive and healing powers plus 4 physical of choice, bio-manipulation, group mind block; hatchling major psionic, 5 powers each from sensitive and healing.', '9-11 ft long, 15 ft wingspan', 'Approximately 300 lbs', '6000-8000 years typical, though 1500-3000 more likely given conflicts with evil', 'Anywhere, prefers forests and wilderness near people; skilled dimensional traveler', 'Other dragons; Spirits of light; Creatures of good alignment', 'Supernatural evil and forces of evil; Cockatrice and Basilisk (favorite prey of those)', NULL, 'A small, elegant, bird-headed serpent dragon called the Feathered Serpent, a compassionate protector of the innocent worshipped by ancient cultures.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.34-36');
  'lo-dox-dragon', 'Lo-Dox Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Vast majority anarchist or miscreant, but can be any', '{"IQ":"2D6+12","MA":"2D6+4","ME":"2D6+6","PS":"3D6+26","PP":"2D6+6","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"2D6+6","Spd":"5D6"}', '5D6x100+PE', '4D6x100', NULL, '4D6x10+120+PE', '1D6x10+60+ME', 'Also swims 6D6+26, flies 2D4x10+60. AR: back (shell) is 18, but underbelly, legs, head, neck and wings are 12 (hatchling 15 and 10). Hatchling: IQ 2D6+6, MA 2D6, ME 2D6, PS 3D6+18, PP 2D6+3, PE 2D6+3, PB 2D6, Spd 4D6 running/6D6+10 swim/2D4x10 fly; HP 1D6x100; SDC 2D4x100+20/lvl; PPE 3D4x10+10/lvl; HF/Awe 11. Rifts conversion: MDC adult 2D4x1000, hatchling 1D4x1000; other stats basically unchanged.', 18, 14, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":1,"pull":2,"roll":4}', '+6 save vs horror factor, +3 other saves (adult); hatchling +3 HF, +2 other saves. AR is much lower (12) on underbelly, limbs, head, neck and wings than on the shell-like back (18).', 'Basic/advanced math 98%; literate Dragonese/Elven plus 2 languages of choice 98%; speaks 4 more at 98%; demon and monster lore +20%, magic lore +10%, gemology +20%, astronomy +20%, fishing +20%, wilderness survival +20%; 3 skills from EACH of Espionage/Military/Scholar-Technical/Wilderness/Weapon Prof, +5% bonus. Avg adult level 1D6+6.', 'Nightvision, hawk-like color and infrared vision (sees through murky water), sees and turns invisible, fast regeneration, fire/cold resistance, strong swimmer, immune to water pressure, breathes without air, teleportation, and limited metamorphosis into aquatic forms only.', 'PPE 1D4x100+280; knows all water elemental magic levels 1-5 plus heal burns, part waters, encase in ice, calm waters; 01-12% chance of an additional discipline (table given).', 'Adult master psionic: all physical powers plus sense magic, telepathy, hydrokinesis, and super telekinesis; hatchling major psionic, 8 physical powers plus hydrokinesis.', '12 ft tall at the back (20 ft with head raised), 10-15 ft wide, 20-25 ft long, 50 ft wingspan', '30 tons', '6000-9000 years', 'Near oceans, seas, or large lakes; often lairs at the bottom', 'None per se', 'Many, earned through its own vindictiveness; Other dragons, sea serpents, and supernatural beings, good and evil', NULL, 'A rare turtle-like winged dragon, cantankerous and reclusive, insulted by comparisons to turtles and prone to petty rivalries with other dragons.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.36-38');
  'night-stalker-dragon', 'Night Stalker Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, but typically anarchist (33%) or evil (60%)', '{"IQ":"2D6+10","MA":"3D6+10","ME":"2D6+12","PS":"2D6+22","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"3D6+10","PB":"5D6","Spd":"1D6x10+10"}', '5D6x100+PE', '3D6x100', NULL, '1D4x100+160+PE', '2D4x10+10+ME', 'Also flies at 2D4x10+30. Hatchling: IQ 2D6+6, MA 3D6+6, ME 2D6+6, PS 2D6+12, PP 2D6+6, PE 3D6+2, PB 4D6, Spd 1D6x10 running/2D4x10 flying; HP 1D4x100; SDC 4D6x10+2D6/lvl; PPE 4D4x10; HF 11. Rifts conversion: MDC adult 1D4x1000+200, hatchling 1D4x100+30; other stats basically unchanged.', 14, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":4,"roll":4}', '+8 save vs horror factor, +4 other saves (adult); hatchling +5 HF, +2 other saves.', 'Basic/advanced math 98%; literate Dragonese/Elven plus 2 languages of choice 98%; speaks 4 more at 98%; forgery +20%, streetwise +20%, demon and monster lore +20%, locate secret doors +10%; 3 skills from EACH of Espionage/Military/Scholar/Rogue/Wilderness/Weapon Prof. Avg adult level 2D4+5.', 'Flying nocturnal dragon with poor day vision (blinded by bright light without eye protection), nightvision, invisibility at will, scent tracking, fast regeneration, fire/cold resistance, metamorphosis, self/dimensional teleport; breathes black flame that can compel mortals toward evil acts.', 'Adult knows all wizard spells levels 1-4 plus necromantic spells (animate/control dead, exorcism, create mummy/zombie, resurrection, etc.); 01-60% chance of extra wizard levels or a second discipline (table given).', 'Adult major psionic, all sensitive powers; hatchling major psionic, 8 sensitive powers.', '8-10 ft tall, 30-40 ft long, 60 ft wingspan', '2.5 tons', '4000-6000 years, some to 8000', 'Anywhere, favors domains of humans, elves, dwarves, kobolds, ogres, Wolfen; especially Western Empire, Old Kingdom, Land of the South Winds', 'Vampires (favorite); Evil sorcerers, witches, dark priests, demons, deevils, dark gods', 'Knights, paladins, good priests, Champions of Light; Most mortal races it preys on', NULL, 'A nocturnal, black-flame-breathing dragon of trickery and greed, allied with vampires and undead, who tempts victims into evil deeds.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.38-40');
  'thunder-lizard-dragon', 'Thunder Lizard Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, typically scrupulous (20%), unprincipled (25%), or selfish (20%)', '{"IQ":"2D6+14","MA":"2D6+14","ME":"2D6+14","PS":"2D6+22","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"2D6+14","PB":"4D6+8","Spd":"6D6+20"}', '1D4x1000+PE', '4D6x100', NULL, '2D4x100+200', '3D4x10+PE', 'Supernatural P.S. Hatchling: HP 1D4x100, SDC 5D6x10+2D6 per level, PPE 3D4x10+PE, ISP 1D6x10+ME, AR 12, HF 11, IQ/MA/ME 4D6, PS 2D6+12, PP 2D6+6, PE 4D6, PB 4D6, Spd 4D6. Rifts Earth conversion: M.D.C. Adult 1D6x1000+500, Hatchling 1D4x100+50; becomes a mega-damage creature, impervious to normal weapons; bio-regen unchanged.', 15, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":3,"roll":4,"pull":5}', 'Adult: +6 save vs horror factor, +4 on all other saves. Hatchling: +3 initiative, +1 strike, +2 parry, +1 dodge, +3 pull punch, +2 roll, +4 save vs horror factor, +2 other saves.; attacks per melee: 7 physical, or 4 fire breath plus 3 physical, or 2 by magic (adult); 5 physical, or 2 fire breath plus 3 physical, or 2 by magic (hatchling)', 'Basic/advanced math 98%, literate Dragonese/Elven 98% plus 4 languages of choice, speaks 6 more at 98%; streetwise +10%, public speaking +20%, land navigation +10%, demon and monster lore +20%, Faerie lore +15%, swim +20%, climb +10%, plus 15 skills from Communications/Espionage/Medical/Military/Rogue/Science/Scholar-Technical/Weapon Proficiencies. Average level 1D6+7 plus I.Q. bonus and +10% skill bonus.', 'Nightvision, excellent color vision, sees and turns invisible, prehensile tail, bio-regenerates, resists fire and cold at half damage, shapeshifts at will, teleports self and across dimensions, and breathes a paralyzing poisonous green flame that harms elementals worst of all.', 'All wizard spells levels 1-5, plus exorcism, detect poison, spoil, agony, curses, animate/create undead, resurrection, heal wounds; 01-70% chance of extra wizard, warlock, summoner, or diabolist magic.', 'Master psionic: all sensitive and physical psi-powers; I.S.P. 3D4x10+PE.', '20 feet tall (6 m), up to 45 feet (13.7 m) long', '20 tons', '6000 years, some to 9000', 'Anywhere, but favors Elves, humans and civilization; most common in the Old Kingdom and Eastern Territory', 'Elves; Titans; Rahu-Men; Champions of Light', 'Forces of evil; Basilisks; Night Stalkers; Serpents of the Wind; Hydras (rivals, for the challenge)', NULL, 'A noble, good-leaning reptilian dragon once dominant in the Old Kingdom; wingless but magically gifted, and a valued protector and ally of elves and knights.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.42-44');
  'ultucan-dragon', 'Ultucan Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, but tend toward selfish and evil alignments', '{"IQ":"2D6+14","MA":"2D6+6","ME":"2D6+16","PS":"2D6+16","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"2D6+12","PB":"2D6+6","Spd":"6D6+10"}', '4D4x100+PE', '3D4x100', NULL, '2D4x100+PE', '3D4x10+60+ME', 'Supernatural P.S. Spd also 6D6x2 flying (adult). Hatchling: HP 1D4x100, SDC 1D4x100+2D6 per level, PPE 3D4x10, ISP 2D4x10+ME, AR 10, HF 11, IQ 3D6+3, MA 2D6+2, ME 2D6+2, PS 2D6+6, PP 2D6+6, PE 3D6+3, PB 2D6, Spd 6D6 running and 6D6+6 flying. Rifts Earth: not known to exist there or in Atlantis; if encountered, treated as a mega-damage creature impervious to normal weapons; no M.D.C. figure printed; bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C. per minute.', 13, 14, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"roll":3,"pull":3}', 'Adult: +6 save vs horror factor, +3 on all other saves. Hatchling: +1 initiative, +2 strike, +1 parry/dodge, +2 pull punch, +2 roll, +3 save vs horror factor, +1 other saves. Weapons of pure iron or pure silver do double damage.; attacks per melee: 8 physical, or 4 fire breath plus 4 physical, or 2 by magic only (adult); 4 physical, or 2 physical plus 2 fire breath, or 2 by magic only (hatchling)', 'Basic/advanced math 98%, sing 98%, literate Dragonese/Elven plus 4 languages at 98%, speaks 6 more at 98%; magic lore +20%, religion lore +15%, dance +20%, preserve food +15%, skin and prepare hides +20%, anthropology +10%, biology +20%, recognize/use poison +20%, interrogation +15%, W.P. knife, plus 3 skills each from Espionage, Medical, and Rogue. Average level 2D4+6.', 'Nightvision, excellent color vision, sees/turns invisible, bio-regenerates, ultrasonic hearing, mimics voices, perfect musical recall, shapeshifts, teleports self and dimensionally; sings magical songs (cheer, bliss, fear, pain, love) swaying emotions and combat ability of listeners.', 'All wizard spells levels 1-4, plus charm, domination, compulsion, agony, mute, age, life drain, detect poison, sanctum, heal wounds; 01-70% chance of extra wizard, necromancy, summoner, or diabolist magic.', 'Master psionic: all healing psi-powers, plus advanced trance state, bio-manipulation, catatonic strike, psi-sword, psi-shield, and mentally possess others; I.S.P. 3D4x10+60+ME.', '12-20 feet (3.6-6 m) tall, up to 60 feet (18.3 m) long (half of it is tail), 40 foot (12.2 m) wingspan', '2D4 tons', '6000 years, some to 9000', 'Found anywhere; known to exist in the Western Empire and Timiro Kingdoms', 'Other evil dragons (Serpents of the Wind are often minions); demons, deevils and gods (as colleagues); monster races used as minions (Boogie-Men, Bug Bears, Goblins)', 'None per se; humans and Elves in general', NULL, 'A rare, delicate, bat-winged dragon obsessed with voice and song, who manipulates, enslaves and experiments on lesser beings while courting demons and sorcerers.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.45-47');
  'wooly-dragon', 'Wooly Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Any, but typically anarchist (60%) or miscreant (20%)', '{"IQ":"1D6+6","MA":"1D6+6","ME":"2D6+10","PS":"3D6+40","PP":"2D6+14","PE":"2D6+14","PB":"4D6","Spd":"3D4x10"}', '1D6x1000+PE', '6D6x100', NULL, '1D6x100', '2D6x10+16', 'Supernatural P.S. Cannot fly (Spd is running only). Hatchling: HP 6D6x100, SDC 3D6x100+4D6 per level, PPE 2D4x10, ISP 2D4x10+6, AR 12, HF 14; remains half adult size for 300 years, reaches maturity at 400; all natural abilities, attacks, damage and skills at half the adult level/percentage. Rifts Earth conversion: M.D.C. Adult 2D4x1000, Hatchling 1D4x100+250; bio-regen becomes 1D6x10 M.D. per melee round.', 14, 16, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":1,"roll":2,"pull":2}', 'Adult: +10 save vs horror factor, +4 on all other saves. Hatchling: +2 initiative, +1 strike, +2 parry, no dodge bonus, +1 pull punch, +1 roll, +8 save vs horror factor, +2 other saves.; attacks per melee: 8 physical per melee (bite, claw, tail, etc.) adult; 4 physical, plus one more at level 6, hatchling', 'Basic math 75%, speaks a guttural form of Gobbledy and Dragonese/Elven 90%, Faerie lore 60%, track animals 90%, track humanoids 85%, wilderness survival 90%, land navigation 85%, swim 80%, climb 70/60%, plus 3 skills each from Technical and Wilderness. Average level 1D6+6; hatchlings get the same skills at -20%.', 'Nightvision 600 ft, sees and turns invisible, tracks by scent, leaps great distances, bio-regenerates, resists fire and cold at half damage, teleports self; cannot fly, cast magic, or take human shape, but can shrink its own size at will.', NULL, 'Major psionic: detect psionics, healing touch, increased healing, and all sensitive psi-powers; I.S.P. 2D6x10+16.', '30-50 feet (9-15.2 m) tall, 80-100 feet (24.4-30.5 m) long', '20-40 tons', 'Average 3000-5000 years; scholars believe the true maximum is only 1000-2500', 'Wilderness; Old Kingdom, Baal-gor Wastelands, Land of the South Winds, one of the Floenry Islands, Yin-Sloth Jungles, the Northern Wilderness/Eastern Territory border, and (by legend) the Land of the Damned', 'None per se', 'None per se; regards all humanoids as natural enemies', NULL, 'A huge, fur-covered, flightless dragon that fights and hunts on primal instinct alone; territorial, magic-less, and unable to change shape unlike other dragons.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.47-49');
  'minor-earth-elemental', 'Minor Earth Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist', '{"IQ":"5","PS":"2D6+28","PP":"1D6+16","Spd":"6D6+20"}', '6D6x10', '4D6x10', NULL, '1D6x100', NULL, 'Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100+300 M.D.C.', 16, 13, '{"attacks":4,"strike":2,"parry":2,"pull":2,"roll":3}', '+5 save vs magic, +4 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info (magic, psionic, and energy attacks; destruction of physical body).; attacks per melee: 4 (or 2 spell attacks)', 'None - R.C.C. and skills not applicable (primordial force of nature).', 'Impervious to poison, disease, and normal weapons; does not breathe; nightvision 1200 ft; identifies earth materials 80%; land navigation 90%; understands all languages; regenerates 1D6x10 SDC/HP per minute (four melee rounds); travels through earth and stone at will.', 'All level 1-4 Earth Warlock spells; spell strength 14 (14+ to save).', NULL, '8-12 feet (2.4-3.6 m) tall', '600-1000 lbs (272-450 kg); none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A hulking, earthen humanoid formed of dirt, clay, or rock; bores through stone, resists conventional weapons, and casts minor earth-based warlock magic.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.55-56');
  'earth-tree-or-plant-elemental', 'Earth-Tree or Plant Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist', '{"IQ":"5","PS":"2D6+24","PP":"1D6+16","Spd":"6D6+16"}', '5D6x10', '4D6x10', NULL, '1D4x100', NULL, 'Major/Elemental Intelligence variant: I.Q. 1D4+4, P.S. 2D6+30, P.P. 1D6+20; Hit Points 6D6x100; S.D.C. 3D6x100. Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100+100 M.D.C.', 14, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":4,"pull":2,"roll":1}', '+4 save vs magic, +3 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info, plus cannot travel through earth/stone at will.; attacks per melee: 5 (Minor) / 10 (Major-Elemental Intelligence); or 2 spell attacks', 'None - not applicable.', 'Resistant to poison, weapons, fire, and cold; senses water and plant life for miles; predicts time and season; floats on water; attacks with entangling vines, binds captives, and whips with branches.; Entanglement, and Tie-Up and Bind, with its vines and branches', 'Minor: all level 1-4 Earth Warlock spells (spell strength 14). Major/Elemental Intelligence: all Earth Warlock spells levels 1-8.', NULL, '10-20 feet (3-6 m) tall if a Minor Elemental; 25-50 feet (7.6-15.2 m) if an Elemental Intelligence', 'One to 10 tons depending on size; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A tree, thorn, or vine mass possessed by an earth elemental into a humanoid monster; entangles, binds, and whips foes while wielding earth magic.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.56-58');
  'minor-earth-lava-elemental', 'Minor Earth-Lava Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist or miscreant', '{"IQ":"4","PS":"2D6+24","PP":"1D6+14","Spd":"6D6+10"}', '6D6x10', '3D6x10', NULL, '1D6x100', NULL, 'Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100+200 M.D.C.', 16, 15, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":1,"strike":2,"parry":1,"pull":2,"roll":2}', '+4 save vs magic, +4 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info, plus magical cold/water attacks do double damage and magic flame weapons do half damage.; attacks per melee: 4 (or 2 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'Impervious to poison, disease, heat, and fire; does not breathe; resists normal weapons; nightvision 1200 ft; identifies earth materials 80%; regenerates 6D6 SDC/HP per round; travels through earth and stone at will.', 'All level 1-3 Earth Warlock and level 1-2 Fire Warlock spells; spell strength 14 (14+ to save).', NULL, '8-12 feet (2.4-3.6 m) tall', 'One or two tons; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A dark, humanoid lava elemental with a cooled crust and glowing molten interior; spits burning lava and breathes caustic fumes.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.58-59');
  'mud-mound', 'Mud Mound', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist or miscreant', '{"IQ":"5","PS":"2D6+20","PP":"1D6+14","Spd":"4D6+10"}', '4D6x10', '3D6x10', NULL, '1D4x100', NULL, 'A Minor Earth Elemental type. Combined H.P. and S.D.C. are never less than 100. Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100+50 M.D.C.', 16, 12, '{"attacks":3,"strike":1,"parry":1,"pull":4,"roll":5}', '+4 save vs magic, +4 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info, cannot travel through earth/stone, plus magic water attacks inflict double damage.; attacks per melee: 3 (or 2 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'Impervious to normal weapons, poison, and disease; resistant to fire, heat, and cold; oozes through cracks, smothers foes, and pulls itself back together after being splattered by explosions or falls.', 'All level 1-4 Earth Warlock spells; spell strength 14 (14+ to save).', NULL, '6-12 feet (1.8-3.6 m) tall', '1000 lbs (450 kg) to one ton; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A minor earth elemental of walking mud and slime; lacks a stone elemental''s power but smothers foes and slicks the ground beneath them.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.59-60');
  'major-earth-elemental', 'Major Earth Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist or miscreant', '{"IQ":"5","PS":"4D6+46","PP":"1D6+20","Spd":"3D4x10"}', '6D6x100+600', '2D4x1000', NULL, '4D6x100', NULL, 'Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 3D6x1000 M.D.C.', 16, 16, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":1,"strike":3,"parry":3,"pull":3,"roll":3}', '+6 save vs magic, +4 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor and possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info only.; attacks per melee: 8 (or 3 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'Impervious to poison and disease; sees invisible; nightvision 1200 ft; natural telepathy 200 ft; regenerates rapidly; travels through earth/stone at will; can dimensionally teleport (32%) and hurl or shower stone at range.', 'All Earth Warlock spells equal to a 10th level Warlock (spell strength 15), plus numerous wizard spells (sense magic, increase weight, climb, life drain, animate and control dead, restoration, transformation, and others).', NULL, '20-50 feet (6-15.2 m) tall', '60-150 tons; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A giant earthen elemental, fragment of a greater Elemental Intelligence, that hurls stone, teleports between dimensions, and commands potent earth magic.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.60-61');
  'minor-air-elemental', 'Minor Air Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist', '{"IQ":"4","PS":"2D6+24","PP":"1D6+16","Spd":"3D6x10"}', '4D6x10', '4D6x10', NULL, '1D4x100', NULL, 'Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100 M.D.C.', 16, 12, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":4,"roll":4}', '+5 save vs magic, +3 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info, plus fire and energy-based attacks/magic do double damage; explosions/impacts of 80+ S.D.C. cause momentary dispersal (lose one attack) instead of damage; psionics do full effect.; attacks per melee: 6 (or 2 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'Impervious to poison, weapons, heat, and cold; turns invisible at will; sees in all light spectrums; squeezes through small openings; prowls 70%; identifies airborne contaminants 80%.', 'All level 1-4 Air Warlock spells; spell strength 14 (14+ to save).', NULL, '8-12 feet (2.4-3.6 m) tall', '600-1000 lbs (272-450 kg); none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A vaporous, ghostlike cloud or mini-tornado elemental of wind; strikes with gale-force blasts and vanishes at will.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.61-62');
  'major-air-elemental', 'Major Air Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist or miscreant', '{"IQ":"1D4+3","PS":"4D6+40","PP":"1D6+24"}', '6D6x100', '2D4x1000', NULL, '4D6x100', NULL, 'Natural A.R. is not numeric - impervious to most attacks (see natural abilities). Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 3D6x1000 M.D.C.; Speed 200 mph (321.8 km)', NULL, 16, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":6,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":6,"pull":6,"roll":6}', '+7 save vs magic, +4 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor and possession. Vulnerable as the Minor Air Elemental (fire/energy double damage, disperses instead of taking 80+ S.D.C. damage, psionics full effect).; attacks per melee: 10 (or 3 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'Impervious to most physical attacks; invisible at will; flies at Mach one in energy form; can dimensionally teleport (38%) and cast Wind Rush cheaply; appears as a giant star-filled eye amid swirling wind and cloud.', 'All Air Warlock spells equal to a 10th level Warlock at 10 times normal range (spell strength 15), plus wizard spells (see aura, weightlessness, heal wounds, restoration, summon fog/rain/storm, and others).', NULL, '30-50 feet (9-15.2 m) tall', 'Not applicable; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A greater air elemental fragment: a swirling mass of wind, cloud, and lightning around one giant star-filled eye, punching foes with wind blasts.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.62-63');
  'minor-fire-elemental', 'Minor Fire Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist', '{"IQ":"5","PS":"2D6+12","PP":"1D6+16","Spd":"6D6+40"}', '5D6x10', '3D6x10', NULL, '1D4x100', NULL, 'Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100 M.D.C.', 13, 14, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"pull":1,"roll":2,"damage":10}', 'No parry or dodge bonuses. +4 save vs magic, +2 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info, plus cold/water spells do double damage, a bucket of water inflicts 4D6, rain does 2D6/round like acid, and hydrokinesis does double damage.; attacks per melee: 5 (or 2 spell attacks); damage: +10 (heat/fire bonus, in addition to P.S. damage)', 'None - not applicable.', 'Impervious to fire and heat; consumes air (half stats in a vacuum); resists normal weapons; sees heat via thermo-imaging; measures temperature 98%; must concentrate (-1 attack/initiative) to avoid igniting what it touches.', 'All level 1-4 Fire Warlock spells; spell strength 14 (14+ to save).', NULL, '8-12 feet (2.4-3.6 m) tall', 'Not applicable; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A walking mass or pillar of fire with a flickering, sometimes humanoid face; burns on contact and fears water and cold.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.63');
  'major-fire-elemental', 'Major Fire Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally anarchist', '{"IQ":"1D4+4","PS":"2D6+22","PP":"1D6+20","Spd":"6D6+60"}', '6D6x100', '1D6x1000', NULL, '3D6x100', NULL, 'Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 2D4x1000 M.D.C.', 15, 14, '{"attacks":9,"initiative":5,"strike":4,"pull":1,"roll":2}', 'No parry or dodge bonuses. +4 save vs magic, +2 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as the Minor Fire Elemental (cold/water double damage, bucket of water 4D6, acid-like rain, hydrokinesis double damage).; attacks per melee: 9 (or 2 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'A huge, humanoid-ish pillar of fire; impervious to fire and heat; consumes air; can dimensionally teleport (23%); in energy form flies 200 mph and is impervious to all but magic, psionics, and M.D. energy on Rifts Earth.', 'All Fire Warlock spells equal to a 10th level Warlock at 10 times normal range (spell strength 15), plus wizard spells (see aura, life drain, energy bolt, energy field, energy disruption, turn dead).', NULL, '20-40 feet (6-12.2 m) tall', 'Not applicable; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A huge fire elemental fragment of an Elemental Intelligence; a towering pillar of flame that teleports between dimensions and wields potent fire magic.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.64');
  'minor-water-elemental', 'Minor Water Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally miscreant', '{"IQ":"5","PS":"2D6+20","PP":"1D6+15","Spd":"1D6x10+10"}', '5D6x10', '3D6x10', NULL, '1D6x100', NULL, 'Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100+50 M.D.C.; Spd doubles in or under water', 13, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":1,"dodge":2,"pull":2,"roll":1}', '+4 save vs magic, +2 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info, plus magic fire attacks do double damage; magical water attacks do normal damage; cold does half damage.; attacks per melee: 5 (or 2 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'Impervious to normal weapons and ocean pressure; can merge invisibly into a larger body of water; seeps through cracks; senses water for miles; predicts storms and tides 90%; reforms after being splattered.', 'All level 1-4 Water Warlock spells; spell strength 14 (14+ to save).', NULL, '8-12 feet (2.4-3.6 m) tall', 'One ton; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A fountain-like or wall-shaped water elemental with crystalline eyes; jets water, engulfs foes, and hides undetectably within larger bodies of water.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.65-66');
  'minor-ice-elemental', 'Minor Ice Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally miscreant', '{"IQ":"4","PS":"2D6+26","PP":"1D6+13","Spd":"1D4x10+10"}', '6D6x10', '5D6x10', NULL, '2D4x100', NULL, 'A Water Elemental in bipedal ice-monster form. Rifts Earth: mega-damage structure with 1D6x100+200 M.D.C.; Spd +20 in or under water', 15, 14, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":2,"pull":1,"roll":2}', '+4 save vs magic, +2 save vs psionics, impervious to horror factor, +14 save vs possession. Vulnerable as per general Elemental info, plus magic fire attacks do double damage; normal weapons do full damage; magical water attacks do half damage.; attacks per melee: 4 (or 2 spell attacks)', 'None - not applicable.', 'A bipedal ice-monster form of a Water Elemental with dagger claws and icicle teeth; impervious to cold and ocean pressure; hurls ice daggers and breathes chilling frost.', 'All level 1-4 Water Warlock spells; spell strength 14 (14+ to save).', NULL, '8-12 feet (2.4-3.6 m) tall', 'One ton; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'Oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods/demons; often used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A Water Elemental in icy, bipedal monster form with dagger claws and icicle teeth, trading some mobility for greater strength and armor.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.66-67');
  'alien-intelligences', 'Alien Intelligences', 'alien', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Any, usually evil (40% miscreant, 52% diabolic, 4% aberrant, 4% anarchist)', '{"IQ":"3D6+12","MA":"4D6+10","ME":"4D6+10","PS":"6D6+22","PP":"3D6+12","PE":"3D6+12","PB":"1D6","Spd":"2D4x10"}', '2D4x10000', '1D6x10000', NULL, '4D6x1000', '1D6x1000', 'Natural form anywhere from suitcase-sized to house-sized, almost always giant; weight a few hundred pounds to tons. Magic level of experience is 2D4+6. Can create 4 to 100 essence fragments (roll percentile: 01-20 four, 21-40 twelve, 41-60 twenty-four, 61-80 fifty, 81-00 one hundred). Rifts Earth: becomes mega-damage, 2D6x10,000 M.D.C., bio-regenerates 1D6x10 M.D.C. per minute.', NULL, NULL, '{"dodge":2}', '+1D6+8 to save vs horror factor, +1D4 on all other saves (plus attribute bonuses). Natural A.R. is printed as 1D4+11 (dice, not fixed) and Horror Factor as 2D4+10 (dice, not fixed) - see uncertain. Holy/rune weapons do double damage; silver and mega-damage weapons do normal damage; other normal weapons only half damage.; Attacks per melee 1D6+6 (hand to hand and/or psionics) or three by magic; +1D6 initiative, +1D6 pull punch, +1D6 roll with impact, +1D6+8 save vs horror factor, +1D4 all saves; the +2 dodge is while flying', 'R.C.C. and Skills generally not applicable (primordial force of nature and magic); most magically understand/speak all languages, literate in 2D6, and know demon and monster lore and magic lore at 88%.', 'Bio-regenerates roughly 100-600 SDC/HP per minute and regrows lost limbs and eyes within a day. Long-range nightvision, sees the invisible, turns invisible at will, immune to poison and disease, does not breathe, resists cold/heat/fire, and takes half damage from normal weapons.', 'Roll percentile for knowledge: Diabolism or Summoning, Necromancy, elemental magic from two or all four categories, or all wizard spells; caster level 2D4+6.', 'Roll percentile for type: healer, sensitive, physical, or all abilities including super; 1D6x1000 I.S.P., powers work at a 2D4+2 level.', 'As big as a house or as small as a suitcase; almost always giant, never humanoid', 'A few hundred pounds to tons', 'Immortal; millions of years old', 'An alien dimension; rare on the Palladium World since the defeat of the Old Ones', 'May conspire with other forces of evil', 'Humans; the forces of good; other Alien Intelligences (rivals)', NULL, 'A generic, immensely powerful extradimensional horror that fragments its life force across worlds, posing as a god or demon lord to feed on worship.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.69-74');
  'essence-fragment', 'Essence Fragment', 'alien', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Same as its originating Alien Intelligence (any, usually evil)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'All mental and physical attributes are half those of the originating Alien Intelligence (not independent dice). The Intelligence may add up to 5000 hit points from its own pool. P.P.E. and I.S.P. are each 10% of the originating Intelligence own pools (Intelligence base P.P.E. 4D6x1000, I.S.P. 1D6x1000), without reducing the originator pools. On Rifts Earth it is a mega-damage creature (no M.D.C. number given).; Hit points PEx100 and S.D.C. PEx3, where P.E. is the originating Alien Intelligence''s', 10, NULL, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":1}', '+4 to save vs illusionary magic, +8 to save vs horror factor, +2 on all other saves (plus attribute bonuses).; attacks per melee: 4 hand to hand/psionic or 2 by magic (6 hand to hand/psionic or 3 by magic if lent 1000 P.P.E.)', 'Same skills as its Alien Intelligence, plus 8 additional skills for the world it currently operates in at base skill level +20 percent (does not increase with experience); rarely takes W.P.s or physical skills.', 'In physical form: resists cold, heat, fire, poison and disease at half effect; immune to further possession; recognizes possession/enchantment; can dimension-teleport home at 45 percent; regenerates 6D6 SDC/HP per minute; needs only minimal food and three hours of sleep.', 'Same magical powers as its originating Alien Intelligence, at half the equivalent power level.', 'Same psionic powers as its originating Alien Intelligence, at half the equivalent power level.', 'Takes the form/size of its possessed host body', 'Same as its possessed host body', NULL, 'Wherever its Alien Intelligence dispatches it; must anchor into a mortal host body within 24 hours or dissipate', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A splintered piece of an Alien Intelligence, sent to another world to possess a mortal body and act with half its parent power.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.72-73');
  'cheruu', 'Cheruu', 'angel', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Any, typically good (60% scrupulous, 15% principled, 15% unprincipled, 8% anarchist, 2% evil)', '{"IQ":"2D4+20","MA":"2D4+24","ME":"2D4+24","PS":"2D6+22","PP":"2D4+20","PE":"2D4+20","PB":"2D6+28","Spd":"1D6x10"}', 'PEx10', 'PEx3', NULL, '400+PE', '150', 'Running speed shown; flying speed is 2D6x10+200.', 10, 12, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":6,"dodge":8,"pull":6,"roll":4,"strike":3,"parry":3}', '+8 to save vs horror factor, +4 on all other saves (plus attribute bonuses). Normal weapons do half damage; silver, fire magic and flaming weapons do double damage. Rifts Earth: 450 M.D.C., bio-regenerates 6D6 M.D. every four melees.; attacks per melee: 7 hand to hand or psionic attacks per melee, or 3 by magic', 'Literate in two languages, basic and advanced math, astronomy and navigation, land navigation, sing, demon and monster lore, faerie lore (all 98%), track 84%, palming 84%, pick pockets 84%, prowl 88%, detect ambush 80%, detect concealment 80%, escape artist 80%, W.P. archery and targeting.', 'Flies and hovers, hawk-like sight to two miles, nightvision 400 ft, sees and turns invisible at will, shapeshifts into a young child, turns 4D6 dead, heals 6D6 SDC/HP every four melees, resurrects mortals 72%, becomes wind-driven mist for one melee round.', 'All level 1-6 Air Warlock spells plus rainbow and wind cushion; spell strength 14.', 'I.S.P. 150. All healing and physical powers plus electrokinesis, telekinesis (super), mind bolt, mind bond, mind wipe, mind block auto-defense.', 'Three feet tall (0.9 m) in humanoid form', '50 pounds in physical humanoid form', '20,000 years; possibly immortal', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Other angels and champions of good', 'Demons; Deevils; vampires; supernatural monsters; evil humans and other evil creatures', NULL, 'The smallest Spirit of Light, appearing as a small winged child; a gentle, protective angel of air favoring children and the suffering innocent.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.78');
  'seraph', 'Seraph', 'angel', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Any, typically good (50% scrupulous, 20% principled, 15% unprincipled, 10% anarchist, 5% evil)', '{"IQ":"1D4+20","MA":"2D4+30","ME":"2D4+24","PS":"2D6+34","PP":"2D4+24","PE":"2D4+26","PB":"2D6+40","Spd":"1D6x10"}', 'PEx10', 'PEx5', NULL, '400+PE', '200', 'Running speed shown; flying speed is 2D6x10+100.', 11, 15, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":10,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":10,"roll":4}', '+10 to save vs horror factor, +2 on all other saves (plus attribute bonuses). Normal weapons do half damage; weapons/psionics/magic of ice and cold or water do double damage; impervious to fire including magic and mega-damage plasma. Rifts Earth: 500 M.D.C., bio-regenerates 6D6 M.D. every four melees.; attacks per melee: 8 hand to hand or psionic attacks per melee, or 3 by magic', 'Literate in two languages, basic and advanced math, land navigation, demon and monster lore and all military skills (96%); prowl 50%, detect ambush 80%, detect concealment 60%, W.P. sword and paired weapons.', 'Flies and hovers, keen vision, nightvision 200 ft, sees and turns invisible at will, shapeshifts into an attractive human or elf, turns 2D6 dead, heals 4D6 SDC/HP every four melees, immune to fire including magic and mega-damage plasma.', 'All level 1-6 Fire Warlock spells plus fire sponge and plasma bolt; spell strength 14.', 'I.S.P. 200. All physical powers plus healing touch, lust for life, attack disease, pyrokinesis, mind bolt, psi-shield, psi-sword.', 'Seven feet tall (2.1 m) in humanoid form', '50 pounds in physical humanoid form, regardless of size', '20,000 years; possibly immortal', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Other angels and champions of good', 'Demons; Deevils; vampires; supernatural monsters; evil humans and other evil creatures', NULL, 'A fiery, courageous Spirit of Light who conjures a flaming sword and rushes to the aid of noble warriors.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.78-79');
  'ariel', 'Ariel', 'angel', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Any, typically good (50% scrupulous, 30% principled, 10% unprincipled, 8% anarchist, 2% evil)', '{"IQ":"1D4+18","MA":"1D6+30","ME":"2D6+24","PS":"2D6+40","PP":"2D6+24","PE":"2D6+40","PB":"2D6+40","Spd":"1D6x10"}', 'PEx12', 'PEx6', NULL, '400+PE', '160', 'Running speed shown; flying speed is 1D6x10+100.', 14, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":8,"roll":4}', '+10 to save vs horror factor, +4 on all other saves (plus attribute bonuses). Normal weapons do half damage. Tends to be overly cautious, especially when protecting others. Rifts Earth: 660 M.D.C., bio-regenerates 6D6 M.D. every four melees.; attacks per melee: 6 hand to hand or psionic attacks per melee, or 3 by magic', 'Literate in two languages, basic and advanced math, land navigation, swim, climb, dance, demon and monster lore and all wilderness skills (96%); prowl 45%, camouflage 65%, W.P. sword, W.P. net.', 'Flies and hovers, keen vision, nightvision 200 ft, sees and turns invisible at will, shapeshifts into an attractive human or elf, turns 2D6 dead, heals 5D6 SDC/HP every four melees, immune to cold and heat, resists fire at half damage; can grow to 24 feet or shrink to 10 feet at will.; at full size: +2 Horror Factor and +8 damage to punches and kicks', 'All level 1-6 Earth Warlock spells plus transference of essence and suspended animation; spell strength 14.', 'I.S.P. 160. All physical powers plus pyrokinesis, psi-shield, psi-sword, telekinetic force field, group mind block.', '10 to 24 feet tall (3-7.2 m) in humanoid form, can change size at will', '500 pounds (225 kg) in physical humanoid form', '20,000 years; possibly immortal', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Other angels and champions of good', 'Demons; Deevils; vampires; supernatural monsters; evil humans and other evil creatures', NULL, 'A powerful, size-shifting earth angel whose calm exterior hides intense emotion; noted for compassion but overcaution in battle.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.79-81');
  'tharsis', 'Tharsis', 'angel', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Any, typically good (40% scrupulous, 40% principled, 10% unprincipled, 4% anarchist, 3% aberrant, 3% other evil)', '{"IQ":"2D4+20","MA":"2D4+22","ME":"2D6+30","PS":"2D4+38","PP":"2D6+20","PE":"2D6+30","PB":"2D6+36","Spd":"2D4x10+20"}', 'PEx10', 'PEx5', NULL, '500+PE', '180', 'Running speed shown; flying speed is 2D4x10+60 flying, 1D4x100 swimming. Also has a swimming speed.', 15, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":6,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":7,"roll":4}', '+12 to save vs horror factor, +4 on all other saves (plus attribute bonuses). Normal weapons do half damage; fire-based magic does double damage. Rifts Earth: 600 M.D.C., bio-regenerates 6D6 M.D. every four melees.; attacks per melee: 7 hand to hand or psionic attacks per melee, or 3 by magic', 'Literate in two languages, basic and advanced math, land navigation, swim, climb, demon and monster lore and all military skills (98%); prowl 50%, track humanoids 80%, track animals 60%, intelligence 70%, streetwise 70%, W.P. staff, W.P. blunt.', 'Flies and hovers, keen vision, nightvision 400 ft, sees and turns invisible at will, can take the shape of a giant sea horse, or of a human or ogre, immune to ocean depth/pressure, immune to cold, resists fire/heat at half damage, turns 3D6 dead, heals 5D6 SDC/HP every four melees; resurrects for only 400 P.P.E.; changes size from 8 to 20 feet at will.; at full size: +2 Horror Factor and +6 damage to punches and kicks', 'All level 1-6 Water Warlock spells plus calm waters, negate magic, anti-magic cloud, transferal, shadow meld, word of truth; spell strength 14.', 'I.S.P. 180. All sensitive powers plus ectoplasm, levitation, hydrokinesis, electrokinesis, psi-shield, psi-sword, hypnotic suggestion, P.P.E. shield, mind block auto-defense.', '8 to 20 feet tall (2.4-6 m) in humanoid form, can change size at will', '300 pounds (135 kg) in physical humanoid form', '20,000 years; possibly immortal', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; found periodically anywhere', 'Other angels and champions of good', 'Demons; Deevils; vampires; supernatural monsters; evil humans and other evil creatures', NULL, 'A wingless, sea-horse-formed avenging angel of water who hunts down those guilty of cruelty and torture with relentless justice.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.81-82');
  'ramen', 'Ramen', 'humanoid', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, but 50% principled, 40% scrupulous, 10% other', '{"IQ":"3D6+3","ME":"5D6","MA":"4D6","PS":"6D6","PP":"4D6","PE":"5D6","PB":"4D6","Spd":"4D6"}', '3D6x40+PE', '2D6x20', NULL, '1D6x10+40', '1D6x10+30', 'PPE gains +6 per additional level of experience; ISP is a base that grows with level. Rifts Earth conversion: mega-damage creature with 1D4x100 M.D.C.', 12, 12, '{"initiative":3,"pull":2}', '+1 on all saving throws, +3 to save vs horror factor; attacks per melee: Hand to hand skill plus two attacks per melee, or an equal number of psionic attacks, or two by magic', 'R.C.C. skills: basic math (+20%), read/speak Dragonese (+20%), speak Gobblely (+20%), hand to hand: expert, climb (+10%), prowl (+10%), track (+10%), intelligence (+20%), wilderness survival (+10%), horsemanship: knight (+15%), plus two additional physical skills, three ancient W.P.s, three modern W.P.s, two technical or communication skills, five secondary skills and one extra language. Only 30% take a specific O.C.C.', 'Half damage from psionic attacks, impervious to mind control, 70 ft nightvision, heals twice as fast as humans, disease resistant, and an innate empathic bond that calms or commands animals at no cost.', '40% are effectively mystics, limited to 4 spells at 1st level and 2 more each level thereafter', 'Empathic transmission (super), empathy, presence sense, nightvision, bio-regeneration, mind block, and psionic empathy with animals', '12 feet (3.6 m) tall', '750 to 900 pounds (337.5 to 405 kg)', '250 years', 'Prefer forests and wilderness, but can live anywhere; almost none live on the Palladium World, inhabiting other realms in the millions', 'Ra; Isis; Horus; Gods of Light', 'Pantheon of Taut (ancestral reptilian rivals)', 'All O.C.C.s available, though many are Mind Mages; only 30% take a specific O.C.C.', 'Leonine humanoid knights of the realm of Ra, descended from an ancient war; loyal feline warriors with an innate bond to animals.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.140');
  'phoenixi', 'Phoenixi', 'humanoid', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, but 40% unprincipled, 20% scrupulous, 40% other', '{"IQ":"2D6+8","ME":"4D6","MA":"4D6","PS":"4D6+2","PP":"3D6","PE":"3D6+12","PB":"4D6","Spd":"4D6"}', '2D6x10+PE', '4D6x10', NULL, '3D4x100', '1D4x100', 'PPE gains +10 per additional level of experience; ISP gains +10 per additional level. Flight speed 3D4x10. Rifts Earth conversion: mega-damage creature with 1D6x10 M.D.C., and their fire damage is mega-damage too.', 12, 10, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":2,"dodge":2}', '+20% to save vs coma/death, +2 to save vs foreign chemicals (poisons, drugs); +3 to horror factor while burning; attacks per melee: Four physical attacks per melee (plus one fire blast when ablaze), or four psionic, or two by magic; dodge: +2 (in flight)', 'Basic and advanced math (+30%), astronomy (+10%), land navigation (+20%), navigation (+20%), wilderness survival (+10%), intelligence (+10%), reads/speaks Dragonese (+20%), speaks Gobblely (+20%), hand to hand: expert, plus three W.P.s, four scholar/technical/noble skills, two communication/rogue skills, five secondary skills and one extra language; uses the psi-mystic/warlock experience table', 'Impervious to fire and heat (even magic/mega-damage), breathe without air, hawk-like vision, heal ten times faster than humans, drug/disease resistant, and can burst into protective magic flame that adds damage and a fire bolt attack.', 'All fire elemental spells, plus mystic portal, dimensional portal and close rift', 'Telepathy, pyrokinesis, and all healing and physical psionics', '10 to 14 feet (3 to 4.3 m) tall', '400 to 700 pounds (180 to 315 kg)', '900 years', 'Forests, wildernesses and places to fly; in the realm of Maip they live in remote privacy', 'Bennu; Gods of Light', NULL, 'Optional R.C.C. with Game Master permission', 'Large bird-humanoid race born of magic, allied with Bennu and the Gods of Light; peaceable mediators able to wreathe themselves in protective flame.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.149-150');
  'tautons', 'Tautons', 'humanoid', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Mainly diabolic, miscreant evil, or anarchist; the few unprincipled or good Tautons are considered aberrations', '{"IQ":"3D6","ME":"3D6","MA":"3D6","PS":"6D6+6","PP":"4D6","PE":"5D6","PB":"2D4","Spd":"6D6"}', '3D6x10+PE', '3D6x10+100', NULL, '1D4x100', NULL, 'PPE gains +10 per additional level of experience. Rifts Earth conversion: mega-damage creature with 1D4x100 M.D.C. and inflicts mega-damage in physical combat.', 15, 12, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3}', '+1 on all saving throws, impervious to poison, +2 to save vs drugs/poison, +8 to save vs horror factor; attacks per melee: Six physical attacks per melee or two by magic (tail sting adds one more)', 'Basic math (+10%), reads/speaks Dragonese (+20%), Gobblely plus two languages (+20%), hand to hand: expert, prowl (+10%), track humanoids (+20%), track animals (+10%), intelligence (+10%), interrogation (+10%), wilderness survival (+20%), plus two skills each from Espionage, Military, Physical and Rogue (+5%), four W.P.s, and five secondary skills', 'Nightvision 70 ft, sees the invisible, resistant to heat/fire/cold (half damage), can shapeshift into a large poisonous snake, swims 98%, holds breath 3D4 minutes, sees well in murky water, heals twice as fast as humans.', 'All Tautons know Wizard magic: seven spells from levels 1-4 to start, three more at 2nd level, and three additional from levels 1-9 at levels 4, 7, 9, 12 and 15', NULL, '11 feet (3.35 m) tall', '600 to 900 pounds (270 to 405 kg)', '200+ years', 'Prefer arid land, deserts and forests near water, but may be found anywhere; a few thousand live near the City of Set', 'Set; other Gods of Darkness (occasionally)', 'Ramen; Priests of Light; Gods of Light', 'Effectively mercenary fighters; Optional R.C.C. with Game Master permission', 'Giant crocodile-headed, scorpion-tailed humanoids bred to destroy the Ramen; bitter, merciless mercenaries loyal chiefly to Set.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.153-154');
  'crocodillians', 'Crocodillians', 'animal', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Not stated', '{"IQ":"2D6+4"}', '3D4x10', '3D4x10', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Intelligent crocodiles, otherwise ordinary in body and behavior; fiercely and exclusively loyal to Sebek.', NULL, NULL, 'Not stated (described as ordinary crocodiles)', 'Not stated', 'Not stated', 'Not stated', 'Sebek', NULL, NULL, 'Ordinary-bodied but intelligent crocodiles; the only minions the god Sebek fully trusts and shields from combat.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.164');
  'pandemonium-greater-demon', 'Pandemonium, Greater Demon', 'demon', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, '85% aberrant, 5% miscreant, 5% diabolic, 5% anarchist', '{"IQ":"2D6+8","MA":"3D6+10","ME":"3D6+10","PS":"5D6+5","PP":"3D6+8","PE":"5D6+10","PB":"2D6+20","Spd":"4D6+20"}', '2D4x10+64+PE', 'PEx8', NULL, 'PEx12', '500', 'Average level of experience 1D6+1 (use the Mind Mage experience table). Cannot fly. Rifts Earth conversion: hit points and S.D.C. combine into total M.D.C.; impervious to normal weapons, but mega-damage weapons, magic and psionics do full damage; Millennium Tree weapons do triple damage.', 12, 14, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":1,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":4}', '+2 on all magic saving throws, +10 to save vs horror factor; attacks per melee: Five physical or psionic attacks per melee, or two by magic', NULL, 'Nightvision 120 ft, flight, sees/turns invisible, shapeshifts to humanoid form, dimensional teleport, immune to poison and to normal fire/cold, fast bio-regeneration, and a mesmerizing gaze that traps victims in nightmarish terror.', NULL, '500 I.S.P.; all sensitive and physical powers, plus detect psionics, mind bolt, P.P.E. shield, and eight of choice from the super psionic category', '10 to 12 feet tall, about 400 pounds (180 kg); can halve its size to pass among Palladium World humans', 'About 400 pounds (printed as 90 kg)', 'Not stated', 'Dyval, in the private realm of Sahtalus; dispatched to the Palladium World disguised as human lovers', 'Sahtalus', NULL, NULL, 'Shapeshifting Deevil bred solely by Sahtalus to seduce mortals, using a hypnotic gaze to dominate victim nightmares and minds.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.194');
  'mormo-ravens', 'Mormo Ravens', 'animal', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Not stated', '{"IQ":"1D4+3"}', '3D6+2', '2D6+6', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"dodge":6,"strike":2}', 'strike: +2 (when dropping objects from above)', NULL, 'Ordinary raven appearance apart from bright blue eyes; Mormo can see through their eyes, communicate with and summon them (3D6) at will; quick-witted and able to speak.', NULL, NULL, 'Ordinary raven size (not stated numerically)', 'Not stated', 'Not stated', 'Hades, within the island realm of Mormo', 'Mormo', NULL, NULL, 'Ordinary-looking but supernaturally intelligent ravens bred by the demon lord Mormo, who watches through their eyes and summons them at will.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.218');
  'great-horned-dragon', 'Great Horned Dragon', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, but tends principled/good; about 12% aberrant evil', '{"IQ":"2D6+18","MA":"2D6+18","ME":"2D6+18","PS":"2D6+40","PP":"2D6+12","PE":"3D6+12","PB":"4D6+12","Spd":"2D4x10"}', '1D4x1000+500+PE', '6D6x100', NULL, '2D6x100+200', '3D4x10+80+ME', 'Flies at 2D6x10+100 Spd (running figure above is on foot). Hatchling stats differ entirely: HP 1D4x100+50, SDC 1D4x100+4D6 per level, PPE 2D6x10+PE+10 per level, ISP 2D4x10+ME, Horror Factor 12, Natural A.R. 11, Spd 4D6 running or 2D4x10 flying; hatchling knows only 1D4+2 spells from levels 1-2. Rifts Earth conversion: M.D.C. Adult 2D4x1000+500, Hatchling 1D4x100+50; other stats given as basically unchanged.', 15, 18, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"roll":4,"pull":4}', 'Adult: plus 8 save vs horror factor, plus 4 all other saving throws. Alternate attack routines: 3 fire breath plus 5 physical, or 3 by magic. Craves magic knowledge, magic weapons, and ancient artifacts; a quest for them can leave it distracted (minus 15% on skills) and blind to danger or enemies.', 'Basic and advanced math 98%, literate Dragonese/Elven plus 4 languages 98%, speaks 6 more languages 98%, demon and monster lore 98%, faerie lore 90%, lore magic +20%, gemology +15%, sing +15%, plus 20 picks from listed skill categories (gets I.Q. bonus and +5%). Average adult level 2D4+8.', 'Keen night vision and color sight, invisibility and see-invisible, prehensile tail, fast bio-regeneration, resistance to fire and cold, at-will shapeshifting, self and dimensional teleport, plus a wide fire breath it can loose several times a round.', 'Adults 8th level or higher know all wizard spells levels 1-6 plus exorcism, resurrection, remove curse, and 3D4+2 more from levels 7-15 (more at 14th and 20th level); 01-70% chance of a second magic discipline (roll or pick: Summoner, Diabolist, Necromancer or priest, Warlock, or other).', 'Adult: I.S.P. 3D4x10+80+M.E.; master psionic, all sensitive, physical, and healing powers plus bio-manipulation and psi-sword.', '20-30 ft tall, up to 70 ft long, 120 ft wingspan', '30 tons', '6000-8000 years, some over 11,000', 'Found anywhere, but drawn to populated or civilized regions; ranges other dimensions chasing magic or rare artifacts', 'other dragons with similar goals; spirits of light; bold adventurers and powerful beings; especially fond of humans and humanoids', 'supernatural monsters; power-hungry forces of evil', NULL, 'The most feared Palladium dragon: scholarly shapeshifters who mingle with mortals, hoard magic knowledge, and wield potent sorcery and psionics.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.27-30');
  'serpent-of-the-wind', 'Serpent of the Wind', 'dragon', 'palladium-fantasy', 1, 'Any, but typically anarchist (30%) or evil (30% miscreant, 25% diabolic, 5% aberrant)', '{"IQ":"2D6+10","MA":"2D6+10","ME":"2D6+10","PS":"2D6+18","PP":"2D6+10","PE":"3D6+10","PB":"4D6","Spd":"1D6x10+10"}', '4D6x100+PE', '3D6x100+60', NULL, '1D4x100+50+PE', '2D4x10+25+ME', 'Hatchling stats differ entirely: HP 1D4x100+40, SDC 3D6x100+2D6 per level, PPE 3D4x10, ISP 1D4x10+20+ME, Horror Factor 10, Natural A.R. 10, Spd 1D4x10 running; hatchling knows all warlock spells levels 1-2 plus 1D4 more from levels 3-4 per level thereafter. Rifts Earth conversion: M.D.C. Adult 1D4x1000+100, Hatchling 1D4x100+20; other stats given as basically unchanged.', 14, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"roll":2,"pull":2}', 'Adult: plus 7 save vs horror factor, plus 3 all other saving throws. Alternate attack routine: 2 by magic instead of physical; favors magic, knives, and bare hands. Cannot fly except by magic; its insane greed often drives it into foolish, deadly situations.', 'Basic math 98%, literate Dragonese/Elven plus 2 languages 98%, speaks 4 more languages 98%, forgery 10%, escape artist +10%, streetwise +20%, surveillance +10%, interrogation +10%, pick locks +15%, locate secret doors/compartments +20%, demon and monster lore +15%, faerie lore +15%, paired weapons, plus 3 picks each from Espionage, Scholar, Rogue, and Weapon Proficiencies. Average adult level 1D6+6.', 'Night vision, invisibility, strong climbing and swimming, scent tracking, prehensile tail, fast bio-regeneration, resistance to fire and cold, at-will shapeshifting, self and dimensional teleport; cannot fly without magic.', 'Adults know all air Warlock spells levels 1-4; 01-75% chance of extra Warlock spells or a second discipline (roll or pick: more Warlock, Wizardry, Summoning, Necromancy or other, or Diabolism).', 'Adult: I.S.P. 2D4x10+25+M.E.; major psionic, all sensitive and physical psi-powers.', '20 ft long', 'One ton', '3000 years, some to 5000', 'Anyplace where murder and plunder are to be found', 'trusts no one truly; sometimes thieves, assassins, black priests, or evil forces; may use monster races as a gang or pawns', 'earns enemies through its greed and murderous ways; treats humans as playthings for sport and slaughter', NULL, 'A greedy, treacherous dragon-thief that schemes, tortures, and kills to seize wealth and magic, grounded except when using sorcery.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.40-42');
  'major-water-elemental', 'Major Water Elemental', 'elemental', 'palladium-fantasy', 0, 'Generally considered anarchist', '{"IQ":"1D4+4","PS":"3D6+44","PP":"1D6+20","Spd":"2D4x10"}', '1D4x1000+6D6x10', '1D6x1000', NULL, '3D6x100', NULL, 'S.D.C. adds 1000 if its body is a collection of sea creatures. Horror Factor is 17 (rather than 14) if it appears as wiggling fish/sea creatures instead of plain water. Travels through water at Mach one (about 670 mph) rather than the running Spd figure above. Rifts Earth conversion: mega-damage structure with 2D6x1000 M.D.C.; bio-regenerates 1D4x10 M.D.C. per melee round in physical form.', 14, 14, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":6,"roll":3,"pull":3}', 'Plus 6 to save vs magic, plus 4 to save vs psionic attacks; impervious to horror factor and possession. Alternate attack routine: three spell attacks instead of hand to hand. Vulnerable to magic fire (double damage) like other elementals; magical water attacks only do normal damage; cold does half damage.', NULL, 'Impervious to normal, kinetic, and stabbing attacks in physical form; merges invisibly into water, undetectable by sonar; seeps through cracks; long-range night vision and weather sensing; fast bio-regeneration; can jet water or engulf and smother a foe.', 'All level 1-4 Water Warlock spells cast at 10th-level strength (opponents save vs 15) and 10x normal range, plus assorted wizard spells: sense magic, see aura, extinguish fires, paralysis: lesser, escape, calling, purification, exorcism, constrain being, negation, oracle, banishment, sanctum, restoration, remove curse, and heal wounds.', NULL, 'Typically 20-40 ft tall in physical form; energy form 10-100 ft', '10-14 tons in physical form; none as an energy being', 'Immortal unless destroyed', 'Indigenous to an alien dimension; can appear periodically anywhere', 'Warlocks; other Elementals; spirits of light', 'oblivious to most life forms, including self-proclaimed gods and demons; frequently used or enslaved by humans and other beings', NULL, 'A fragment of the Water Elemental Intelligence, taking the form of flowing water or fused sea creatures, fighting with jets, engulfment, and warlock magic.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.67-69');


